model:
  name: 2134-Check
  description: This worksheet provides a comprehensive overview of customer and order information, including details about customer location, market segment, and contact information. It also captures key aspects of each order, such as pricing, quantity, shipping preferences, and associated costs. The data enables analysis of sales performance, customer demographics, and supply chain logistics. (AI generated)
